  "_comment": [
    "SYNTHETIC — hand-built from the documented response shapes in Yahoo's official",
    "Fantasy Sports API guide and from published wrapper-library samples (yfpy,",
    "yahoo_fantasy_api). NOT a live capture. Yahoo API access is gated behind an",
    "approval application and NO live call has ever been made from this repo.",
    "Replace with a real redacted capture once API access is approved.",
    "",
    "AUTHORED 2026-08-11 (not captured on any date).",
    "MODELS: GET /fantasy/v2/league/449.l.529351/settings?format=json",
    "",
    "REDACTION: all identifiers invented. No token, email, real GUID or real",
    "league key appears anywhere in this directory.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS IS COMMITTED: it is the NEGATIVE of",
    "yahoo_league_settings_auction.json, and the pair is what makes three",
    "provider-shaped booleans testable rather than assumed:",
    "  * is_auction_draft = \"0\"  → parse_draft_results() must stamp",
    "    draft_kind='snake' and is_price_bearing=0, which is what tells a later",
    "    reader that a NULL auction_cost means 'the concept does not apply here',",
    "    not 'we failed to read a price'.",
    "  * divisions ABSENT entirely → uses_divisions must stay NULL and",
    "    num_divisions NULL. Absent is not 'zero divisions'.",
    "  * uses_faab = \"0\" → a genuine zero, and it must not be confused with the",
    "    ABSENT faab_balance two keys later.",
    "This is also the 2024 season (game key 449), so the pair proves nothing in the",
    "parser is pinned to one game id — game ids are NOT derivable (2019=390,",
    "2020=399, 2024=449, 2025=461) and a hardcoded one silently reads the wrong",
    "season.",
    "",
    "SHAPE HAZARDS DELIBERATELY PRESENT:",
    "  1. 'league' is a heterogeneous ARRAY; 'settings' is a one-element ARRAY.",
    "  2. This league chains BOTH ways: renew '423_481226' (2023) and renewed",
    "     '461_576919' (2025). Yahoo's renew/renewed use an UNDERSCORE format that",
    "     is not a league key; canonical_league_key() rewrites it to",
    "     '423.l.481226'. Storing both forms would create phantom duplicate",
    "     leagues.",
    "  3. waiver_type 'R' (rolling list) with uses_faab '0' — the non-FAAB world.",
    "  4. IR (not IR+) as the injury slot, and 6 BN slots, so slot classification",
    "     is proven to come from THIS league's own roster_positions rather than a",
    "     global pattern match.",
    "  5. num_keepers is present as \"0\" while uses_keepers is \"0\" — both genuine",
    "     zeros, not absences.",
    "",
    "TRUNCATED: 6 stat categories instead of Yahoo's full ~70-entry NFL",
    "dictionary. Reason: the scoring-join code path is already exercised",
    "exhaustively by yahoo_league_settings_auction.json (display-only stat,",
    "zero-modifier stat, bonuses, three position_types). Repeating it here would",
    "add bulk without adding a covered branch. What IS unique here is the settings",
    "flags above, and those are complete."
